  "title": "Join the September 24th, 2026 Knowledge Portal Webinar!",
  "bodyHtml": "<p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(33, 37, 41);font-family:Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Join us for the next Knowledge Portal Network webinar:<br>? Large-Scale Genomics and Proteomics to Study Diabetes and Cardiometabolic Diseases<br>? Thursday, September 24th, 2026<br>⏰ 12:00–1:00 PM ET<br>?️ Featured speaker: Satoshi Yoshiji, MD, PhD–Assistant Professor, McGill University &amp; Visiting Scholar, Broad Institute</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(33, 37, 41);font-family:Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Topics we will cover:</p><ol><li>A brief primer on large-scale biobanks with genomic and proteomic data </li><li>How these data can be used to understand disease biology and nominate candidate effector genes for diabetes and cardiometabolic diseases</li><li>How data from the Knowledge Portal can support such research<br>&nbsp;</li></ol><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(33, 37, 41);font-family:Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0px;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">? <a style=\"background-color:transparent;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 123, 255);text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://broadinstitute.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN__dgDoIUZSVyPwKvZ3Xx7mQ\">Register for the event</a></p><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/September%2024th%2C%202026%20KPN%20Webinar%20(1).png\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"a7b119b0-1afd-4166-85c2-195448fa8e51\" alt=\"\"></p>",
